sistentVolumeClaim (a reference to a PersistentVolumeClaim in the same namespace)\n    ClaimName:   unavailable-claim\nEvents:\n  Warning  FailedScheduling  35m                default-scheduler  0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod..\n  Warning  FailedScheduling  10m (x5 over 30m)  default-scheduler  0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod..\n关键状态/事件:", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/c9341f56cbd44c92-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/c9341f56cbd44c92-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/c9341f56cbd44c92-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.summary.txt"}

