data: {"id": "c9341f56cbd44c92-final", "run_id": "c9341f56cbd44c92", "seq": 656, "ts_ms": 1789115933750, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v03/workload` | Pending | aiops-case-v03/workload Pod 处于 Pending 状态，未被调度 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-087b04b639f2/fact-faf57aecd1ac`: `FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found` | **直接归零**：调度器明确报告因找不到 PVC 导致 0/3 节点满足条件 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-0f569aa55819`: Pod `aiops-case-v03/workload` 状态 `Pending` | **确认症状**：Pod 处于待调度状态，尚未运行 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `fact-439a01697f79/fact-b4cdfcb29761`: CPU 请求 `5m`，内存请求 `8Mi` | **排除资源争用**：资源需求极低，非因集群资源耗尽导致挂起 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `fact-293ae71c7e76`: `kube_pod_status_phase` phase=Pending 值为 `1` (2026-09-11T08:38:16.022000Z) | **独立观测**：通过 Prometheus 确认目标 Pod 处于 Pending 状态 |\n| 5 | Tool Output | kubectl | `kubectl_get_by_name`: `Error from server (NotFound): persistentvolumeclaims \"unavailable-claim\" not found` | **证据闭合**：验证了 PVC 确实不存在，证实调度事件中的错误原文 |\n\nK8s Event 与 Prometheus Metric 在“Pod 处于 Pending”这一现象上互相印证。直接调用 `kubectl` 检查 PVC 返回 NotFound，提供了该 Pod 永远无法被调度的决定性证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nPod 定义引用不存在的 PVC 'unavailable-claim' → 调度器检测到依赖 PVC 未绑定/不存在 → 0/3 节点满足调度条件 (FailedScheduling) → Pod 永久滞留于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n根因已确认：Pod `aiops-case-v03/workload` 依赖的持久卷声明 `unavailable-claim` 在命名空间 `aiops-case-v03` 中不存在。\n\n- **事实支撑**：调度事件明确指出 `persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found`（#1），且直接检查该资源的命令返回 `NotFound`（#5）。\n- **排除干扰**：Pod 的资源请求（#3）非常低，且集群中有 3 个节点可用（事件原文），因此挂起纯粹由缺失的持久卷声明引起，而非资源不足。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 12.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v03/workload: 41.4s (Evidence 34.6s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v03/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 63.159, "metrics": {"run_id": "c9341f56cbd44c92", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 63.16583824157715, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 63165.83824157715, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 59300.652265548706, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 7466.996192932129, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3516.409158706665}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 12255.36656379699